	(text "MCU - STM32F411RET6 LQFP64. Implements: COL-COTS-0024. Pin map: vault Main-Board-01 MCU Pinout (EN on TIM3, IPROPI on ADC1 E/S edges, ENC on TIM2/TIM1 capture). Layout: docs/design/parts/STM32F411.md. Yaw reserved pins PA9/PB12/PC4 left unconnected per vault. PROVISIONAL (owed to vault): I2C1 on PB8/PB9, DRV_nSLEEP on PC5, nFAULT on PC0-2/PC10, RC_OUT on PB6/PB7/PA10/PA11."
